1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:10,700
MoveBooks AI by Movers & Ledgers: move your books, keep your confidence. This local demonstration uses bounded synthetic data, with every financial approval left to the user.

2
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:36,300
Play makes migration approachable. Walk through Eli’s office, inspect the evidence and reconcile a clearing account before choosing its destination. Game progress never approves or moves financial records.

3
00:00:36,300 --> 00:01:03,700
Try Your Data downloads a documented template and validates permitted synthetic files in this browser. A journal imbalance blocks the package; replacing the files allows a fresh review. Public upload and workspace creation remain unavailable.

4
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:27,300
Explore Demo follows one synthetic business through Understand, Prepare, Move, Verify and Start. Discovery and readiness precede a versioned plan.

5
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:50,000
Account 1200, Misc Clearing, needs judgment. Request an independent second opinion and bounded advice; the displayed public Beta mode is deterministic fallback, not live Gemini.

6
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:10,900
The accountant reviews all mappings and separately approves the migration plan. Advice and second opinions cannot authorize financial writes.

7
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:31,800
Deterministic tools move the approved synthetic manifest. A controlled duplicate stops the batch; completed checkpoints stay intact until a person reviews the remedy.

8
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:54,800
Moving records is not proof. Deterministic reconciliation checks counts, relationships, balances and documents before reviewed configuration can be applied.

9
00:02:54,800 --> 00:03:13,000
Onboarding checks the governed prerequisites. The owner reviews invoice terms, approves posting, then runs the first synthetic task and verifies its accounting effect.

10
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:23,100
The first productive invoice is verified against its approved contract and exact accounting effect: USD 100.00 plus 7.25 tax, total 107.25. This is synthetic verified use, not production readiness.

11
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:51,880
Source-grounded architecture assigns financial authority to Cloud SQL and bounded operational controls to Firestore. This recording exercised local deterministic fallbacks. The diagram is architecture evidence, not a live cloud console or a production claim.
